    "bf.code.wait.7q2fba":["dad","Closed tin, water, pets indoors, watching line. Check all four first. Then we can talk about the taper."],
    "bf.cooled.15r44gg":["dad","Hot end down. Lovely. You remembered the important bit. Leave the wires in the water."],
    "bf.dad.talk.1dguuhl":["dad","Tin shut, bucket full, pets indoors, everyone behind the rope, long taper. Five checks. No cutting corners."],
    "bf.dad.talk.1wfrt7z":["dad","Safety checks all done. Dry wood only on the stack. Friday evening: torch at the rope, then supper. I do the lighting."],
    "bf.display.away.15tnmi0":["dad","The display will carry on. Come back behind the rope when you are ready; you can still finish watching."],
    "bf.display.checks.1fqatvb":["dad","Finish the dry stack and all five Firework Code checks first."],
    "bf.display.resume.1lc7fy1":["dad","You are back! All finished safely. Stay at the rope while I check everything."],
    "bf.display.resume.z6a2bk":["dad","The display carried on. Come back behind the rope and look up."],
    "bf.display.start.14xltvy":["dad","Missed Friday? I saved a few. No jobs tonight: just stay behind the rope and watch. I do all the lighting. The show carries on if you leave; come back here to finish."],
    "bf.display.start.f55ktr":["dad","I have checked for animals. Torch this way, everyone behind the rope. I light one, then come back. The display carries on if you leave; come back to the rope to finish."],
    "bf.display.time.1dhhkkv":["dad","Half past six until ten in the evening. Warm things on, and watch from the rope."],
    "bf.end.aqcnqs":["dad","All finished. I am making everything safe. Stay here while I check. Thank you for watching from the rope!"],
    "bf.history.18sdxer":["dad","Bonfire Night remembers a plot in 1605 to blow up Parliament. Our Guy is old clothes and newspaper. Dad nearly donated his good trousers."],
    "bf.lead.2w6y11":["dad","Bonfire Night on Friday. Help me stack the dry garden wood, and you two can make a Guy. Closed firework tin stays with me."],
    "bf.line.2cmfdz":["dad","Everyone stays behind the rope. Always follow the distance on the box. Never throw fireworks and NEVER go back to one, even if it has gone quiet. Leave it to me."],
    "bf.rocket.1a6z6bq":["dad","Here comes the rocket. Stay back. Never go back to a firework, even if it seems to have stopped."],
    "bf.sparkler.done.110908g":["dad","Hot wire into the bucket now, please."],
    "bf.sparkler.done.72262s":["dad","That was lovely. All the hot wires are in the water. Supper time."],
    "bf.sparkler.wait.1o96ayr":["dad","Display first, sparklers afterwards. I have not forgotten."],
    "bf.tail.talk.times.8y9bbq":["dad","Cold sticks in the bin. Leave the ash alone. If you missed Friday, I saved leftovers for the evening, half past six until ten."],
    "bf.tail.tw78cy":["dad","I have damped the fire right down and checked the cold rubbish. Sticks and wrappers into the bin, please. Leave the ash alone; I will check it again."],
    "bf.taper.te7i05":["dad","A long taper, at arm length. One adult in charge: me. Check! We light the bonfire after checking it for animals. No petrol or paraffin. All ready for Friday evening."],
    "bf.tin.1dmucg3":["dad","Shop-bought, in their closed tin, up out of reach. No fireworks in pockets. I read the instructions and light one at a time. You watch from behind the rope."],
    "bf.water.1vy2tmp":["dad","Bucket filled and parked behind the rope. Used sparklers go in hot end first. The wire stays hot, even when it looks cold."],
    "bf.wood.ncj5f5":["dad","Dry wood and cardboard only. Paper, then kindling. No aerosols, glass, paint, plastic or fireworks on the fire. We check for hedgehogs before lighting."],
    "house.moment.1djssky":["dad","Bed! Now!",null,"dad-shout"],
    "house.moment.hwj5im":["dad","Is that the Internet on? Do you know how much those phone calls cost?"],
    "house.moment.wd8c5e":["dad","Have you been using the phone? The bill came.",null,"dad-shout"],
    "house.voice.h701ve":["dad","TURN THAT DOWN! IT'S THE MIDDLE OF THE NIGHT!",null,"dad-shout"],
    "hw.dad.match.hliuf7":["dad","Hang on, matches are my job. Long match, arm's length... there we go."],
    "hw.dad.safe.l28lnk":["dad","Only knock on doors with the lights on, and never go in anyone's house. Mom's rules. And mine."],
    "st.carry.4c83tp":["dad","E carries it. Take it to the marked place on your desk. Q puts it back safely."],
    "st.carry.wzg82y":["dad","Plug in the marked leads, then press the power button."],
    "st.opening.dad.165n9l8":["dad","The office is chucking out the old computers. Mine is in the boot if you want it. Mind the monitor: it weighs a ton!"],
    "st.opening.lead.power.1h9zqa3":["dad","Everything on the desk? Plug the leads into the matching sockets, then try the big button."],
    "st.opening.part.monitor.inylew":["dad","Both hands on that monitor. No running on the stairs."],
    "st.opening.pc.oltv5s":["dad","There you go. Your own computer. Try not to fill it with games."],
    "phone.in.0.17arros":["gran","Hello love! It's Gran. Is your Mom there? ...No? Never mind."],
    "phone.in.0.1fq2uuq":["gran","Are you still playing on that computer? Your Grandad says it'll make your eyes go square."],
    "phone.in.0.1qgwsdv":["gran","Are you eating properly? You're still growing. I've knitted you a jumper. It's got a reindeer on it."],
    "phone.in.0.reply.0.tcd887":["gran","Lovely. I'll send it in the post. Bye love! Bye! Bye bye! Bye!"],
    "phone.in.0.reply.1.isje3h":["gran","Ooh. Well, as long as you're happy. Love to your Mom. Bye love! Bye bye!"],
    "phone.out.01632960213.1c5kgqp":["gran","Hello? Ooh, you never ring! Eating properly? Grandad says hello. HE SAYS HELLO. Bye, love! Bye! Bye bye!"],
    "bf.already.food.otebpt":["mom","Supper is on the garden table. Help yourself."],
    "bf.carry.food.1ar533q":["mom","E carries the tray to the little garden table. Gloves on, mind."],
    "bf.cat.check.1q6dwpi":["mom","The cat is indoors. Keep the bedroom window shut tonight. Give the cat a quiet place to hide when the bangs start."],
    "bf.cat.check.3jrkba":["mom","The cat is safely indoors, hiding under the bed. Let the cat stay cosy."],
    "bf.cat.check.p22a1x":["mom","The cat is indoors. Keep the bedroom window shut for the display. Give the cat a quiet place to hide when the bangs start."],
    "bf.cat.safe.1n6nrdc":["mom","The cat is safely indoors, hiding under the bed. Let the cat stay cosy. We will feed the cat when the bangs have stopped."],
    "bf.cat.w6iuui":["mom","The cat is indoors with the curtains shut. Let the cat hide under the bed; keep the noise down in here. No need to pull the cat out."],
    "bf.day.5k1dof":["mom","Bonfire Night! Potatoes, parkin and warm gloves. The washing is in and Dad has put the whirly line away. Keep the cat indoors."],
    "bf.finale.1gp0jav":["mom","Ooooh! Look at those gold ones. Like golden rain!"],
    "bf.gloves.wait.prep.8fedwg":["mom","Hat, gloves, wellies ready for Bonfire Night. Do the Firework Code with Dad before the sparklers."],
    "bf.gloves.wait.wmjtee":["mom","Hat, gloves, wellies. It will be cold tonight. Do the Firework Code with Dad before the sparklers."],
    "bf.mom.talk.1ypwr09":["mom","Jacket potatoes with cheese and beans, sticky parkin and treacle toffee. Help at the kitchen worktop. Then warm clothes on. No cold fingers tonight."],
    "bf.mom.talk.late.1ogjaal":["mom","It is getting late. Help me put the supper things away, then off to bed."],
    "bf.mom.talk.prep.ouvann":["mom","Jacket potatoes with cheese and beans, sticky parkin and treacle toffee. Help at the kitchen worktop. Have warm clothes ready for Bonfire Night. No cold fingers when we watch the display."],
    "bf.parkin.tzx22w":["mom","Sticky ginger cake. Best made a day or two ahead. There is treacle toffee too. You can help with the potatoes; I do the hot oven and hot sugar."],
    "bf.sparkler.gloves.hhvm6u":["mom","Gloves first! They are on the stool by the back door."],
    "bf.supper.1cixt9h":["mom","Cheese and beans in your jacket potato? Parkin in the tin, treacle toffee on the plate. Mind your teeth. Hot sugar is my job, thank you."],
    "chore.rating.16wxa7r":["mom","Did you actually do it or just move it about?"],
    "chore.shout.106ah51":["mom","Ooh, ta!"],
    "chore.shout.12cu3fo":["mom","Ta, love."],
