    "st.opening.bed.hra5bz":["mom","Much better. Now straighten that bed, please."],
    "st.opening.bin.lnlsdo":["mom","One last job: bring the bin bag down to the kitchen."],
    "st.opening.meetmom.p0ty2g":["mom","Morning, love. Room first, then you can do what you like. Clothes in the basket, rubbish in the bin, plates down to the kitchen."],
    "st.opening.tidy.1d8mogt":["mom","First things first: clothes in the basket, rubbish in the bin. And bring your dishes down!"],
    "bf.already.guy.1f4ztpk":["sister","Our Guy is sitting in the garden, guarding the parkin."],
    "bf.carry.guy.13p6v71":["sister","E carries him out to his garden chair. Careful with his head!"],
    "bf.display.done.1lj1fzs":["sister","The golden one was my favourite!"],
    "bf.guy.135iti6":["sister","Dad said we could have his OLD clothes. Not his work trousers. I have checked twice."],
    "bf.guy.ready.16vdl6h":["sister","He looks just like Dad on a Sunday. Can we keep him? Penny for the Guy! He only takes pretend pennies."],
    "bf.sister.talk.1gj0870":["sister","Will you help me stuff the Guy? Dad's old shirt is on the kitchen table. He says it was fashionable once."],
    "bf.sister.talk.1kq0e9g":["sister","Remember, remember, the fifth of November! I remembered. Dad forgot where he put his hat."],
    "bf.wheel.qsib2":["sister","A Catherine wheel! It is doing cartwheels!"],
    "house.moment.1ci1e5k":["sister","Can I have a go on the Game Lad? Pleeeeease?",null,"sis-whine"],
    "house.moment.vtvqfy":["sister","MOM! They're being annoying!"],
    "hw.sis.bat.1p6s4es":["sister","Higher! No, lower! Perfect. It's watching you."],
    "hw.sis.ghost.b0szgt":["sister","Now the whole street can see him. His name is Gerald."],
    "hw.sis.scoop.j7h9ib":["sister","Ewww! It looks like brains. Can I keep the seeds?"],
    "c4.xmas.eve.dad.neutral":["dad","Is everyone asleep yet? Good. Shh. I am eating the mince pie."],
    "chore.shout.1of6vkv":["mom","Have you done ALL your jobs? Who are you and what have you done with my real helper?"],
    "house.voice.1o2t39k":["mom","School! Shoes on, bag ready, out you go!"],
    "house.voice.1p91ht0":["mom","Tea is ready! Come and get it before it goes cold!"],
    "house.voice.6sjah6":["mom","Saturday pocket money! Check with me when your jobs are done."],
    "house.voice.v8d3ia":["mom","Time for bed. Save your game.",null,"mom-call"],
    "house.voice.zrj5mn":["mom","Ooh, have you done ALL your jobs? Who are you and what have you done with my real helper?"],
